@startuml GupShup Cafe - User Join and Discussion Sequence

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 20

title GupShup Cafe - User Join and Discussion Flow (MVP)

actor "User (Alice)" as Alice
participant "React App" as React
participant "Socket.io\nClient" as SocketClient
participant "AWS Fargate\n(FastAPI)" as Backend
participant "Room Manager" as RoomMgr
participant "Database\n(SQLite/EFS)" as DB

== User Authentication ==

Alice -> React : Open app
React -> React : Check auth status
React -> Alice : Show LoginPage

Alice -> React : Click "Sign in with Google"
React -> Backend : POST /api/auth/google
Backend -> DB : Get/Create user record
DB --> Backend : User data (id, CEFR level)
Backend --> React : Auth token + user info
React -> React : Store auth in AuthContext
React --> Alice : Redirect to LobbyPage

== Join Room ==

Alice -> React : View online rooms
React -> Backend : GET /api/rooms
Backend -> RoomMgr : Get active rooms
RoomMgr --> Backend : Room list
Backend --> React : [Room1, Room2, Room3]
React --> Alice : Display room cards

Alice -> React : Click "Join Room: Tech Talk"
React --> Alice : Prompt for anonymous name
Alice -> React : Enter "Blue Panda"

React -> SocketClient : emit('join-room', {roomCode, name})
SocketClient -> Backend : join-room event

Backend -> RoomMgr : join_room(roomCode, participant)
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Create Participant object
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Add to room.participants[]

RoomMgr -> DB : INSERT participant
DB --> RoomMgr : participant_id

RoomMgr --> Backend : Success
Backend -> Backend : Emit to all in room

Backend --> SocketClient : 'participant-joined' event
SocketClient -> React : Update participants list
React --> Alice : Show "Blue Panda joined!"

Backend --> SocketClient : 'participants-update' event
SocketClient -> React : Update RoomState context
React --> Alice : Refresh participant cards

== Ready Check ==

Alice -> React : Check mic & network
Alice -> React : Click "I'm ready to start!"

React -> SocketClient : emit('ready', {roomCode})
SocketClient -> Backend : ready event

Backend -> RoomMgr : set_participant_ready(sid)
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : participant.is_ready = true
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Check if all_ready()

alt All Participants Ready
    RoomMgr --> Backend : all_ready = true
    Backend --> SocketClient : 'all-ready' event
    SocketClient -> React : Enable "Start Discussion" button
    React --> Alice : Button turns green
else Still Waiting
    RoomMgr --> Backend : all_ready = false
    Backend --> SocketClient : 'participant-ready' event
    SocketClient -> React : Update UI
    React --> Alice : Show "2/3 ready"
end

== Start Discussion ==

note over Alice, DB
    Host clicks "Start Discussion"
end note

React -> SocketClient : emit('start-discussion', {roomCode})
SocketClient -> Backend : start-discussion event

Backend -> RoomMgr : start_discussion(roomCode)
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : room.status = IN_PROGRESS
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Set current_speaker_index = 0
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Start timer (60 seconds)

RoomMgr -> DB : UPDATE session status
DB --> RoomMgr : Success

RoomMgr --> Backend : Discussion started
Backend --> SocketClient : 'discussion-started' event
SocketClient -> React : Update RoomState

React -> React : Navigate to RoundtablePage
React --> Alice : Show circular table view

Backend --> SocketClient : 'turn-started' event
SocketClient -> React : currentSpeakerIndex = 0
React --> Alice : Highlight current speaker
React --> Alice : Start 60-second timer

== Speaking Turn ==

note over Alice
    Alice's turn to speak
end note

Alice -> React : Unmute microphone
React -> React : AudioContext.toggleMute()
React --> Alice : Speaking indicator appears

Alice -> Alice : Speaks into mic (WebRTC audio)

note over React, Backend
    Audio flows via WebRTC P2P
    to other participants
end note

React -> React : Web Speech API transcribes
React -> SocketClient : emit('speech-transcript', {text})
SocketClient -> Backend : speech-transcript event

Backend -> DB : INSERT transcript
DB --> Backend : transcript_id

Backend -> Backend : Queue for LLM analysis

== Timer Expires ==

React -> React : Timer reaches 0
React -> SocketClient : emit('end-turn')
SocketClient -> Backend : end-turn event

Backend -> RoomMgr : next_speaker(roomCode)
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Increment speaker_index
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Check if round complete

alt Round Complete
    RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Increment current_round
    RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Reset speaker_index = 0
    Backend --> SocketClient : 'round-complete' event
    SocketClient -> React : Show "Round 1 complete!"
else Same Round
    RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Move to next speaker
end

Backend --> SocketClient : 'turn-started' event
SocketClient -> React : Update currentSpeakerIndex
React --> Alice : Highlight next speaker

== End Discussion ==

note over React, RoomMgr
    After 3 rounds complete
end note

RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Check if max_rounds reached
RoomMgr --> Backend : Discussion complete

Backend -> DB : UPDATE session (ended_at)
DB --> Backend : Success

Backend --> SocketClient : 'discussion-ended' event
SocketClient -> React : Show summary screen

React --> Alice : Display feedback & stats
Alice -> React : Click "Leave Room"
React -> SocketClient : emit('leave-room')
SocketClient -> Backend : disconnect

Backend -> RoomMgr : remove_participant(sid)
RoomMgr -> RoomMgr : Remove from room
RoomMgr --> Backend : Participant removed

React --> Alice : Redirect to LobbyPage

@enduml
